  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "詩寫辭典：空"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>顏銘俊</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄是每一擺中秋</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng點ē to̍h一pha</span></p></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">天尾頂ê圓滿</span></p></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄是每一湧雲浪</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng píng ē出日頭ê溫暖hām</span></p></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">留戀</span></p></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">風　tsông--leh tsông--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā ē雄雄無聲無sueh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">葉仔生--leh生--leh、青--leh青--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā ē跋做áu鬱--你、áu鬱--lán ê</span></p></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">huánn-huánn或者暗暗紅紅ê</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心酸hām心悶　心事hām</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心願</span></p></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">啊若溪水流--leh流--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā ē流做記持ê江海</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">或者m̄知是啥mih人ê</span></p></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無人看無人聽</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">mā無人掛意ê</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">目屎</span></p></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">所以講--啊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">每一齣夢境</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lóng ē搬演無仝氣味、無仝旋律ê</span></p></div><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奇幻　每一蕊浮phue̍h</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">lóng ē分分秒秒閃爍做</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無仝ê色彩、無仝ê情節、無仝ê</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">世界　tsit个世間--啊！</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哪有啥mih tiānn-tiānn bē tín動、乖乖bē變化ê</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">永遠？</span></p></div></blockquote><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEitiefrhap1NkfrhTF1QFF4RucOd9E_7DLV_0HzU2P1zTmy6q59MXh76-KUFTD-WvpkAIShEP_N0JCxbEnhF7z4D0vQ2ZMohfQ6B2aEwflaDtHnxEQbNpTjT4wNTXZwLaZIoV4UXz6G2_HHsKNs_Xj2eHdrvVFKHOzPG1kjTJitEga-a8-IlLLurzeyUx-T/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1366%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEitiefrhap1NkfrhTF1QFF4RucOd9E_7DLV_0HzU2P1zTmy6q59MXh76-KU